user-data/data.vdi SHA256
7f58fb36c934405757da797ca65f2dddef3858e69107f43e2cae59d14c89bc5f

The first editor's documented limitations remain: 400 ASCII source bytes in the
guest filesystem service, keyboard editing, manual Zero/Ezero language choice,
no debugger/process sandbox, and a one-line GUI diagnostic excerpt.
